system ConversationContext  @app/chatbot/agents/historymanager/
  actor Router
  cfg depth = 5 turns, turnLimit = 4000 bytes
  req HM-1 when a message depends on earlier turns, recover the context it needs from the last depth turns and hand it back to the router; never answer the user
  req HM-2 with no earlier turns, return no context and do not ask the model
  req HM-3 each turn carries user text, attachment names, assistant text and file actions, each cut to turnLimit
  activity RecoverContext: load turns -> build transcript -> [empty] return none | ask LITE model -> return context
